Translate the following sentences from English to Spanish.  
\begin{enumerate}
    \item I am very tired.
    \item This saxophone is old.
    \item The Spanish is a difficult language.
    \item They are talkers.
    \item Charles is very poor.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Estoy muy cansado.
\item Este saxofón es antiguo.
\item El español es un idioma difícil.
